    "description": {
      "content": "The Commusoft API is a RESTful JSON-based API designed to allow third parties to integrate products and applications with Commusoft's field service management platform. It enables programmatic management of jobs, customers, engineers, quotes, invoices, parts, and service histories for trades businesses including HVAC, plumbing, electrical, and building maintenance contractors. The API supports integrations with accounting tools (QuickBooks, Xero, Sage), payment processors (Stripe, GoCardless), and workflow automation platforms (Zapier).",
